WEBVTT

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:21.910
This is the Shibuya Division!

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:23.750
There's glitter and sparkles galore.

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:25.620
And all sorts of cute and lovely.

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:29.830
It's a cheerful, lighthearted town
that's brimming with excitement.

00:00:29.830 --> 00:00:34.870
Spread your wings of freedom,
everybody, and fly about town!

00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:37.750
Huh?

00:00:37.750 --> 00:00:40.250
Wait? For how long?

00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:43.910
I am under no obligation
to answer your questions.

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:46.290
We will initiate the <i>action </i>from our end.

00:00:46.290 --> 00:00:47.580
Okey-dokey.

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:49.950
Leave the <i>reaction </i>to me.

00:00:49.950 --> 00:00:51.500
Just kidding!

00:00:52.580 --> 00:00:53.660
Tsk...

00:02:24.910 --> 00:02:28.870
Ah-hahaha. Lose again at slots, Dice?

00:02:28.870 --> 00:02:32.620
I kept playin' till I ran out of cash,
so I'm all tapped out.

00:02:32.620 --> 00:02:35.200
So please, gimme somethin' to eat!

00:02:35.200 --> 00:02:39.040
Haven't you heard the saying,
"He who does not work, neither shall he eat?"

00:02:39.040 --> 00:02:41.080
Gambling is my job!

00:02:41.080 --> 00:02:46.750
Ah-hahahaha. Paying to work?
You're an example to laborers everywhere.

00:02:46.750 --> 00:02:50.000
Stop bein' sarcastic, and lemme have some grub!

00:02:51.450 --> 00:02:55.200
One of mine hands containeth some nourishment.

00:02:55.200 --> 00:02:57.200
Guess which hand,
and the food is thine for the taking.

00:02:57.200 --> 00:03:01.410
No shit?! Okay, I pick your right hand!

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:08.160
There's nothin' there!
This another one of your lies?!

00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:10.790
I'm mortified that thou wouldst suggest that.

00:03:10.790 --> 00:03:13.370
Both hands held the correct answer.

00:03:13.370 --> 00:03:17.290
Gamblers live on nothing but air, do they not?

00:03:17.290 --> 00:03:19.120
It's hermits that do that!

00:03:19.120 --> 00:03:22.080
"Creepy! Ghosts Rampant in Shibuya Division"

00:03:23.290 --> 00:03:27.910
An acquaintance of one
of my friends said she saw them.

00:03:27.910 --> 00:03:33.580
All of a sudden this fog appeared,
and three shadows emerged from it.

00:03:33.580 --> 00:03:38.790
The shadows opened their big mouths
and came to swallow her up.

00:03:38.790 --> 00:03:43.830
She was super scared and covered in goose bumps.
Then, she screamed and passed out.

00:03:43.830 --> 00:03:46.540
Hey, Ramuda. They were talkin' about ghosts.

00:03:46.540 --> 00:03:48.250
Y-Yeah, it seems they were.

00:03:48.250 --> 00:03:51.950
So... do you hate ghosts?

00:03:51.950 --> 00:03:56.660
N-No, I don't hate them.
Actually, I kinda like them.

00:03:56.660 --> 00:04:00.700
Sometimes people say
they hate what they really love,

00:04:00.700 --> 00:04:03.000
but from what this humble bard hath seen,

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:07.370
thou sayest thou lovest what thou really hatest.

00:04:07.370 --> 00:04:12.620
Ramuda! Afraid of ghosts at your age?!

00:04:12.620 --> 00:04:15.450
They don't exist,
so how could I be scared of them?

00:04:15.450 --> 00:04:19.950
Hmm. Thou believest that
ghosts don't exist, Ramuda?

00:04:19.950 --> 00:04:21.950
I think they do.

00:04:21.950 --> 00:04:23.750
They do not.

00:04:23.750 --> 00:04:28.160
"Anyone betting on even? Anyone betting on odd?"

00:04:28.160 --> 00:04:30.750
Would ye care to make a wager on it?

00:04:30.750 --> 00:04:34.370
Since thou art so certain, Ramuda,
thou wouldst wager that ghosts aren't real.

00:04:34.370 --> 00:04:36.750
And Dice would wager that ghosts are real.

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:38.040
Mmm.

00:04:38.040 --> 00:04:40.910
I'm betting they're real, huh? Sounds fun.

00:04:40.910 --> 00:04:43.080
I'm tinglin' with excitement.

00:04:43.080 --> 00:04:44.620
Okay! I'm in!

00:04:44.620 --> 00:04:46.620
Why do I have to do something like...

00:04:46.620 --> 00:04:48.660
Oh, you tryin' to get out of it?

00:04:48.660 --> 00:04:51.080
As if!

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:57.870
O-Okay then, if I win, you've got
to model the clothes I've designed, Dice.

00:04:57.870 --> 00:05:02.950
I've got a lot of sparkly, fluffy,
and cute clothes for you to wear.

00:05:02.950 --> 00:05:04.580
A-All right.

00:05:04.580 --> 00:05:08.580
Okay, if I win... let's see here...

00:05:08.580 --> 00:05:11.450
Got it! You've gotta pay
for my meals for a whole week.

00:05:11.450 --> 00:05:12.790
Uh, no, wait a sec!

00:05:12.790 --> 00:05:16.040
All right then, do we have a deal?

00:05:16.040 --> 00:05:19.250
How do we decide the winner?

00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:23.870
The three of us shall venture forth
to confirm the existence of ghosts.

00:05:23.870 --> 00:05:27.910
We shall be ghost busters--nay, exterminators

00:05:27.910 --> 00:05:31.620
and tear the sheets off these ghosts.

00:05:31.620 --> 00:05:33.080
All right, it's settled then.

00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:35.580
Ah! Hahaha!

00:05:35.580 --> 00:05:39.410
I totally forgot I've got a work deadline.

00:05:39.410 --> 00:05:41.330
I'm such a ditz!

00:05:41.330 --> 00:05:44.290
So, everyone out... Out!

00:05:44.290 --> 00:05:48.290
Nuh-uh! The dice have been cast!
You can't back out of this now.

00:05:48.290 --> 00:05:50.250
Come, the streets of Shibuya await!

00:05:50.250 --> 00:05:53.330
We'll be cursed if we do that.

00:05:56.750 --> 00:05:59.950
Come on out, you ghosts.

00:05:59.950 --> 00:06:02.370
I'll foot the bill, so you
don't gotta foot it over here!

00:06:02.370 --> 00:06:05.330
The trouble is the ghosts and
thou both lack the means to "foot" anything.

00:06:05.330 --> 00:06:07.500
You're right about that! Hahaha!

00:06:07.500 --> 00:06:12.000
C'mon, let's not say anything to provoke them.

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:15.870
Whaddya mean? Ghosts don't exist, right?

00:06:15.870 --> 00:06:17.830
O-Of course they don't, but...

00:06:17.830 --> 00:06:20.910
...I didn't say they do. I didn't!

00:06:20.910 --> 00:06:21.790
Oh!

00:06:21.790 --> 00:06:23.620
Hey, Ramuda!

00:06:23.620 --> 00:06:25.830
Hyahhh!

00:06:27.580 --> 00:06:30.370
--Heh-heh-heh-heh-heh!
--Bwahahahahaha!

00:06:30.370 --> 00:06:32.290
"DOGENZAKA KOJI"

00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:38.120
You all right there, Ramuda?

00:06:38.120 --> 00:06:39.870
What do you mean?

00:06:39.870 --> 00:06:44.160
Nothing's going on, so of course I'm all right.

00:06:44.160 --> 00:06:48.410
Well now, there's no point
in simply walking around.

00:06:48.410 --> 00:06:51.660
'Twould be nice to have something to go on...

00:06:51.660 --> 00:06:53.330
Prithee, go around and... ask.

00:06:53.330 --> 00:06:54.910
Wahhh!

00:06:54.910 --> 00:06:55.750
Oh, I'm so sor--

00:06:55.750 --> 00:06:57.830
Noooo!

00:06:57.830 --> 00:06:58.950
Ah, oops!

00:06:58.950 --> 00:07:00.700
Eyahhhhh!

00:07:01.410 --> 00:07:03.080
Kyahhhhhhh!

00:07:03.080 --> 00:07:05.450
I... can't take any more of this!

00:07:06.790 --> 00:07:12.160
"Reserved Tonight"
"Horror Night Costume Party"

00:07:16.750 --> 00:07:20.500
Ramuda, nothin' scary'll getcha in here.

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:24.370
I'm telling you; I'm not scared or anything.

00:07:24.370 --> 00:07:27.540
I once heard such a tale as this...

00:07:27.540 --> 00:07:28.870
Huh?

00:07:28.870 --> 00:07:33.870
Having missed the last train because
he'd been working overtime, an office worker

00:07:33.870 --> 00:07:36.370
had no choice but to take
a taxi home from work one night.

00:07:36.370 --> 00:07:38.540
W-Wait, what's this story of yours?

00:07:38.540 --> 00:07:42.910
The man resided in Shinjuku.

00:07:42.910 --> 00:07:45.290
He drifted off to sleep for a moment,

00:07:45.290 --> 00:07:50.040
and when the driver stopped the car
and said, "We've arrived, sir,"

00:07:50.040 --> 00:07:52.580
the place they'd stopped at was...

00:07:52.580 --> 00:07:54.790
...the Aoyama Cemetery.

00:07:54.790 --> 00:07:56.870
The cemetery? But that's...

00:07:56.870 --> 00:07:59.370
...in a completely different direction.

00:07:59.370 --> 00:08:01.870
Thinking there must've
been some mistake, the man

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:06.250
clearly stated the address once more
and got the driver to take him back there.

00:08:06.250 --> 00:08:07.290
And...

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:11.790
The man nodded off again.
The car stopped, and...

00:08:11.790 --> 00:08:14.540
...they were back at the
Aoyama Cemetery once again.

00:08:14.540 --> 00:08:18.910
Hey! Why are you telling us a
creepy taxi story while we're inside a cab?

00:08:18.910 --> 00:08:22.580
It's kinda givin' me the chills too.

00:08:22.580 --> 00:08:28.870
The office worker griped about how awful
it was to make the same mistake twice.

00:08:28.870 --> 00:08:31.040
Yet the driver claimed that

00:08:31.040 --> 00:08:34.700
he was only following the directions
of the office worker's companion,

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:36.700
and that's what brought them there.

00:08:36.700 --> 00:08:39.540
Wait a sec, inside the taxi there was...

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:44.620
That's correct.
There was only the office worker.

00:08:44.620 --> 00:08:48.330
Then the driver said,
"Look, that's who I'm talking about."

00:08:48.330 --> 00:08:52.660
And where he pointed,
there was a woman in a white dress.

00:08:52.660 --> 00:08:56.250
--Stop, stop, stop, stop, stop, stop, stop!
--Wahhhhhhhhhhhhhh!

00:08:59.040 --> 00:09:01.250
I've had enough already!

00:09:01.250 --> 00:09:03.620
Hey, ain't cha takin' it a little too far?

00:09:04.540 --> 00:09:06.290
Wh-Where are we?

00:09:06.290 --> 00:09:07.580
The Aoyama Cemetery.

00:09:07.580 --> 00:09:10.450
Kyahhhhh!

00:09:10.450 --> 00:09:13.450
'Twas but a lie.

00:09:13.830 --> 00:09:16.950
Eyahhh! Cemeteries are creepy!

00:09:16.950 --> 00:09:21.080
Hold up. This ain't no cemetery.

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:23.200
Hey, you're right.

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:25.950
Oh! Isn't that a live music club?

00:09:25.950 --> 00:09:29.540
Should be nice and lively in there
and not scary at all! Yayyy!

00:09:29.540 --> 00:09:31.870
Wait up! I'm comin' along!

00:09:39.290 --> 00:09:40.750
Open sesame!

00:09:40.750 --> 00:09:42.790
Eh-heh... Huh?

00:09:53.080 --> 00:09:54.580
Huh?!

00:09:54.580 --> 00:09:58.000
We rarely get many customers.

00:09:58.000 --> 00:10:00.750
How nice of you to drop by!

00:10:00.750 --> 00:10:03.540
--Gyahhh! Spooky!
--Hyahhh!
--Wahhhh!

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:06.500
S-Stay right there! Don't come any closer!

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:09.370
There's no need to be so frightened.

00:10:09.370 --> 00:10:15.790
This is the live music club MAHOJIN,
and I am its owner Kuroya Sabasu.

00:10:15.790 --> 00:10:19.540
C'mon! Why do you gotta be so scary?!

00:10:22.790 --> 00:10:27.830
I'd always somehow managed
to get by here in the Shibuya Division.

00:10:27.830 --> 00:10:31.660
But then, the artists and
groups that used to play here,

00:10:31.660 --> 00:10:37.750
one by one they all just stopped coming.
God only knows why.

00:10:37.750 --> 00:10:40.040
Maybe your face creeped them out...

00:10:40.040 --> 00:10:42.620
No performers means...

00:10:42.620 --> 00:10:44.080
...no customers, huh?

00:10:44.080 --> 00:10:47.410
Because of that, my club may be open,
but it's hardly getting any business...

00:10:47.410 --> 00:10:50.200
I switched to candlelight
to save on my electric bill.

00:10:50.200 --> 00:10:52.580
And cut down on food as well.

00:10:52.580 --> 00:10:56.950
Just look at how emaciated
I've become! Eh-heheheheh!

00:10:56.950 --> 00:10:59.330
What a creepy face!

00:11:00.200 --> 00:11:01.500
Hm?

00:11:01.500 --> 00:11:05.120
Say, you guys wouldn't happen to be Fling Posse?

00:11:05.120 --> 00:11:07.080
Thou hast heard of us?

00:11:07.080 --> 00:11:10.330
Figures you should know,
runnin' a live music club and all.

00:11:10.330 --> 00:11:12.910
Nope. You're mistaken.

00:11:12.910 --> 00:11:14.790
And I'm going home.

00:11:14.790 --> 00:11:16.950
See ya around!

00:11:16.950 --> 00:11:19.750
Guys, won't you put on a show here?

00:11:19.750 --> 00:11:24.120
Huh? No way! I can't perform
in a creepy place like this.

00:11:24.120 --> 00:11:29.120
If you fill the house, I'll let you have
all the proceeds from the ticket sales.

00:11:29.120 --> 00:11:31.200
But you have to cover all the expenses.

00:11:31.200 --> 00:11:33.040
Whoa! Winner-takes-all, huh?

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:35.540
Dice! Don't get any funny ideas!

00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:37.910
But methinks it soundeth most interesting.

00:11:37.910 --> 00:11:40.080
Not you too, Gentaro...

00:11:40.080 --> 00:11:45.450
I just thought everyone would show up
if the great Fling Posse performed here.

00:11:45.450 --> 00:11:49.080
He's askin' for our help, Ramuda. Whaddya say?

00:11:49.080 --> 00:11:53.040
Ramuda, thy measure as
a man is being put to the test.

00:11:53.040 --> 00:11:55.330
I don't really care what people think.

00:11:55.330 --> 00:12:02.200
Aw, c'mon! We won't scare ya anymore,
so let's sock it to 'em!

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:05.660
Or dost thou admit that thou wast afraid?

00:12:05.660 --> 00:12:08.370
I wasn't really afraid.

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:11.250
Yeah...

00:12:11.250 --> 00:12:15.410
I guess it'd be far better to please the ladies.

00:12:15.410 --> 00:12:17.370
All right, then. I'll do it.

00:12:17.370 --> 00:12:19.250
Ohhhh!

00:12:19.250 --> 00:12:25.080
But as long as we're doing this,
I'm gonna make sure we sell the place out.

00:12:37.660 --> 00:12:40.750
"Create Post | Post"

00:12:37.660 --> 00:12:40.750
"Next Friday Fling Posse will
perform live at CLUB MAHOJIN. Be there!"

00:12:47.410 --> 00:12:49.830
The show's finally happening tomorrow.

00:12:49.830 --> 00:12:54.450
After all, money--scratch that--our
pride is on the line here.

00:12:54.450 --> 00:12:56.370
What are you saying?

00:12:56.370 --> 00:12:59.620
A concert is a place for
the audience to enjoy themselves.

00:12:59.620 --> 00:13:03.200
Our job is merely to help them do that.

00:13:03.200 --> 00:13:06.080
The ladies are the main characters here.

00:13:12.000 --> 00:13:13.790
Hey, hey, hey everybody!

00:13:13.790 --> 00:13:15.700
Fling Posse in da house, y'all!

00:13:15.700 --> 00:13:17.910
Wel... come...

00:13:17.910 --> 00:13:19.370
Huh?!

00:13:22.540 --> 00:13:25.250
One, two, three...

00:13:25.250 --> 00:13:27.200
Ah-hahaha...

00:13:29.120 --> 00:13:30.540
What are you guys doing?

00:13:30.540 --> 00:13:33.250
Munching on squid jerky.

00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:37.000
Only three people came,
and they're eating squid jerky...

00:13:37.000 --> 00:13:43.370
Eating squid jerky toughens up
the frail jaws of modern men...

00:13:44.830 --> 00:13:47.910
...so that they can tear
into the most sinewy flesh.

00:13:47.910 --> 00:13:49.870
Uhhh...

00:13:49.870 --> 00:13:52.790
We're street photographers.

00:13:52.790 --> 00:13:57.580
You've been getting a lot of attention in Shibuya,
so we came to take some photos.

00:13:57.580 --> 00:14:02.790
But it seems even the great Fling Posse
was no match for the ghosts of Shibuya.

00:14:02.790 --> 00:14:05.200
What do you mean, ghosts?

00:14:05.200 --> 00:14:08.250
The ghosts that haunt
Shibuya's live music clubs.

00:14:08.250 --> 00:14:09.870
Haven't you heard of them?

00:14:09.870 --> 00:14:12.500
I don't believe it for a second.

00:14:12.500 --> 00:14:14.330
Huh? Just a--

00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:18.040
"I wanted to go to the Fling Posse show!"

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:19.620
"I was hoping to see Ramuda!"

00:14:19.620 --> 00:14:21.330
"I was <i>so </i>looking forward to seeing them live!"

00:14:21.330 --> 00:14:23.200
"But... they're playing at <i>that </i>live music club."

00:14:23.200 --> 00:14:24.790
"Yeek, that place is haunted."

00:14:24.790 --> 00:14:26.830
"I can't go because ghosts creep me out."

00:14:26.830 --> 00:14:28.370
What <i>is </i>this?

00:14:28.370 --> 00:14:30.200
This can't be...

00:14:30.200 --> 00:14:31.330
Mr. Sabasu...?

00:14:31.330 --> 00:14:35.830
You see, I thought if I'd told you
the truth, you wouldn't perform here.

00:14:35.830 --> 00:14:37.950
What's the meanin' of this?!

00:14:37.950 --> 00:14:41.120
Thou shalt tell us the whole story
and leave naught out.

00:14:41.120 --> 00:14:48.580
Well, all the artists and groups that
used to perform here said they saw them.

00:14:48.580 --> 00:14:51.040
Ghosts, that is.

00:14:51.040 --> 00:14:52.870
They really <i>do </i>exist...

00:14:52.870 --> 00:14:57.370
So, people stopped coming
to play here because they were afraid to...

00:14:57.370 --> 00:14:59.540
And the customers stopped coming as well...

00:14:59.540 --> 00:15:01.830
It's not just my club.

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:04.950
They've popped up in live
music clubs all over Shibuya.

00:15:04.950 --> 00:15:06.700
Ghosts, that is.

00:15:06.700 --> 00:15:11.200
All the clubs are just like mine--so empty
you can hear the crickets chirping.

00:15:11.200 --> 00:15:13.000
All over Shibuya, you say?

00:15:13.000 --> 00:15:17.830
So, the ghosts got a grudge against
live music clubs or musicians or somethin'?

00:15:17.830 --> 00:15:23.200
That maketh no sense.
'Twas just the other night...

00:15:23.200 --> 00:15:27.620
We spied those costumed folks
emerge from that establishment.

00:15:27.620 --> 00:15:29.830
Business was prospering at that live music club.

00:15:29.830 --> 00:15:30.120
"Reserved Tonight"
"Horror Night Costume Party"

00:15:29.830 --> 00:15:30.120
Business was prospering at that live music club.

00:15:30.120 --> 00:15:32.330
"Reserved Tonight"
"Horror Night Costume Party"

00:15:30.120 --> 00:15:32.330
Oh, you're talking about CLUB COLONY.

00:15:32.330 --> 00:15:35.830
For some reason that club
is packed night after night.

00:15:35.830 --> 00:15:40.790
They do events, concerts,
DJ parties--you name it.

00:15:40.790 --> 00:15:43.450
They say the place was
established not too long ago.

00:15:43.450 --> 00:15:48.450
That club was the only one...
to be spared from harm, huh?

00:15:54.950 --> 00:15:57.910
Ichiro! Long time no see!

00:16:01.830 --> 00:16:03.830
'Sup, Ramuda?

00:16:03.830 --> 00:16:05.160
Huh? What?

00:16:05.160 --> 00:16:07.660
You want us to look into it?

00:16:07.660 --> 00:16:10.870
Hey, you know anything about a live music club
in Shibuya called CLUB COLONY?

00:16:10.870 --> 00:16:13.500
Hmm, don't think I've heard of it.

00:16:13.500 --> 00:16:15.790
Just give me 5 minutes, and I can manage.

00:16:15.790 --> 00:16:18.910
Sure. Okay, we'll do it!

00:16:18.910 --> 00:16:23.160
Okay, thanks! Bye now!

00:16:24.870 --> 00:16:29.250
All right, let's see what kind
of feet these ghosts have.

00:16:30.330 --> 00:16:36.830
Sure enough, CLUB COLONY has a
pretty bad rep among those in the business.

00:16:36.830 --> 00:16:40.290
Just because it's the only club in
Shibuya that's doing decent business now,

00:16:40.290 --> 00:16:42.250
they think it gives them the right
to haggle over performance fees.

00:16:42.250 --> 00:16:45.540
Their staff act all full of themselves
and think they can do whatever they want.

00:16:45.540 --> 00:16:51.330
The three co-owners used to be members
of a rap group called Space Colony.

00:16:51.330 --> 00:16:54.080
People say these guys are some major badasses.

00:16:54.080 --> 00:16:56.120
Ex-rappers, huh?

00:16:57.620 --> 00:16:59.660
So, that's how they did it.

00:16:59.660 --> 00:17:03.000
With a hypnosis mic,
it's possible to make people hallucinate

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:05.410
and plant terror in their hearts.

00:17:05.410 --> 00:17:08.660
I see, the ghosts were an illusion.

00:17:08.660 --> 00:17:11.330
That's inexcusable.

00:17:11.330 --> 00:17:14.500
Depriving the ladies of their good time.

00:17:14.500 --> 00:17:16.200
It's not funny!

00:17:19.500 --> 00:17:22.330
We're gonna do another show at that club.

00:17:22.330 --> 00:17:25.120
But, with all this fuss goin' on...

00:17:25.120 --> 00:17:28.410
...it's still unlikely to draw a crowd.

00:17:28.410 --> 00:17:33.790
Not to worry! This time I'll make
sure the ladies'll definitely show up.

00:17:38.540 --> 00:17:42.790
"Hi-de-ho! Ramuda of Fling Posse, here!

00:17:42.790 --> 00:17:45.120
You guys have been naughty.

00:17:45.120 --> 00:17:50.040
I know the secret behind the ghosts,
and I wanna talk with you about it."

00:18:13.120 --> 00:18:14.620
G-Ghosts!

00:18:27.660 --> 00:18:30.580
Noooooooo!

00:18:31.580 --> 00:18:34.080
Heh-hehehehe!

00:18:34.080 --> 00:18:44.290
Ah-hahahahahaha! Hahahahaha!
Ah-hahahahahaha! Hahahahaha!

00:18:47.290 --> 00:18:50.000
Behold, the men behind the ghosts!

00:18:50.000 --> 00:18:52.790
You tried to make us forget
the secret behind the ghosts

00:18:52.790 --> 00:18:56.830
by freaking us out with scary hallucinations.

00:18:56.830 --> 00:18:58.750
But we won't fall for that trick.

00:18:58.750 --> 00:19:01.830
Damn. You're right. That's exactly what we did.

00:19:01.830 --> 00:19:03.500
By causing a ghost scare,

00:19:03.500 --> 00:19:08.410
we hoped to steal customers
from live music clubs all over Shibuya.

00:19:09.700 --> 00:19:12.660
Say, let's talk this over.

00:19:12.660 --> 00:19:16.200
Why don't you come work with us exclusively?

00:19:16.200 --> 00:19:20.040
You'll be working sold-out gigs
for a huge performance fee.

00:19:20.040 --> 00:19:21.620
Not too bad now, is it?

00:19:21.620 --> 00:19:24.250
Oh, but it is. It is.

00:19:24.250 --> 00:19:26.660
Right? You all heard what he said, didn't you?

00:19:26.660 --> 00:19:28.910
The ghosts were all made-up.

00:19:28.910 --> 00:19:30.620
There's nothing to be afraid of anymore,

00:19:30.620 --> 00:19:32.910
all you ladies watching the livestream!

00:19:32.910 --> 00:19:34.160
Huh?!

00:19:40.330 --> 00:19:41.750
What a creepy face!

00:19:41.750 --> 00:19:45.410
Damn! You leave us no choice. We'll flatten you!

00:19:46.870 --> 00:19:50.160
Dice! Gentaro! You guys ready?

00:19:50.160 --> 00:19:51.500
We're doing our latest!

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:52.250
OK!

00:19:52.250 --> 00:19:54.870
Let us sally forth!

00:19:55.910 --> 00:19:59.040
♬ Yeah! Shibuya Ghost Busters ♬

00:19:59.040 --> 00:20:01.790
♬ Fling Posse is gonna use our mics to clean up ♬

00:20:01.790 --> 00:20:03.500
♬ Let's go! ♬

00:20:04.580 --> 00:20:06.790
♬ Both gals and ghouls
are (hey) captivated by me ♬

00:20:06.790 --> 00:20:08.910
♬ Mr. Lollipop in Shibuya style, you see ♬

00:20:08.910 --> 00:20:13.330
♬ Choosin' the hippest words
to make it hop, (ah) Ramu in da house ♬

00:20:13.330 --> 00:20:15.500
♬ No mercy even for a playmate ♬

00:20:15.500 --> 00:20:17.370
♬ Upon further examination,
do your knees quake? ♬

00:20:17.370 --> 00:20:19.910
♬ P-H-A-N to da T-O-M (yeah) ♬

00:20:19.910 --> 00:20:21.910
♬ Shibuya Division KING of STAGE ♬

00:20:21.910 --> 00:20:24.080
♬ I'll wrap myself with the sheets from you ghosts ♬

00:20:24.080 --> 00:20:26.290
♬ Anybody who's in, on my back you go ♬

00:20:26.290 --> 00:20:28.250
♬ Keep raising that bet ♬

00:20:28.250 --> 00:20:30.750
♬ This game is already set ♬

00:20:30.750 --> 00:20:32.790
♬ An unfunny scenario by a ghost writer ♬

00:20:32.790 --> 00:20:35.160
♬ Vacuuming up all your money
like the "Ghost Busters" ♬

00:20:35.160 --> 00:20:37.370
♬ A lil scary, I'm on thin ice... ♬

00:20:37.370 --> 00:20:39.450
♬ Gotta be wise, don't believe the hype! ♬

00:20:39.450 --> 00:20:40.200
♬ Fling Posse ♬

00:20:40.200 --> 00:20:41.700
♬ Just time flies ♬

00:20:41.700 --> 00:20:43.830
♬ Call on Ramuda, Dice, and Gentaro ♬

00:20:43.830 --> 00:20:46.080
♬ Neon lights shining on Friday Night ♬

00:20:46.080 --> 00:20:48.160
♬ Chasing away your nightmares ♬

00:20:48.160 --> 00:20:50.410
♬ Give me a minute, dance carefree ♬

00:20:50.410 --> 00:20:52.580
♬ Chasing away your nightmares ♬

00:20:52.580 --> 00:20:53.330
♬ Fling Posse ♬

00:20:53.330 --> 00:20:54.830
♬ Just time flies ♬

00:20:54.830 --> 00:20:57.410
♬ Call on Ramuda, Dice, and Gentaro ♬

00:21:07.700 --> 00:21:09.580
Oh, Ramuda!

00:21:09.580 --> 00:21:11.040
Owww!

00:21:11.870 --> 00:21:14.620
Rather coquettish, aren't they?

00:21:14.620 --> 00:21:17.000
Oh, Ramuda!

00:21:19.950 --> 00:21:22.540
Welcome, ladies!

00:21:22.540 --> 00:21:24.450
Sorry to keep you all waiting!

00:21:24.450 --> 00:21:27.580
We're crankin' it up and
burnin' down the house tonight!

00:21:27.580 --> 00:21:30.000
Try and keep up with us!

00:21:37.540 --> 00:21:39.870
Oh, this is nice!

00:21:39.870 --> 00:21:43.080
And this one's cute, too.
It might look good on you.

00:21:43.080 --> 00:21:46.000
I lost the bet,
so there's nothin' I can do about it.

00:21:46.000 --> 00:21:49.830
I'm like putty in your hands.
Have your way with me.

00:21:49.830 --> 00:21:54.870
Hmm, there's got to be something cute here
that's more in tune with your world, Dice.

00:21:54.870 --> 00:21:56.500
Which one could it be?

00:21:56.500 --> 00:21:58.870
Oh, hold on there.

00:21:58.870 --> 00:22:01.660
We must let this photo decide
who the real winner is.

00:22:01.660 --> 00:22:02.830
Huh?

00:22:04.120 --> 00:22:06.120
"Ramuda! Behind you! Behind you!!"
"Like, totally creepy!!"

00:22:07.250 --> 00:22:09.660
Th-This is...

00:22:10.370 --> 00:22:14.580
A spirit photograph?!

00:22:14.580 --> 00:22:19.580
Gyahhhhh!
